	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Generic end-launch (edge-mount) SMA jack, generated for a 1.6 mm substrate (er 4.5). Signal pad 2.95 mm wide to match the 50 ohm line; coplanar ground set back 2.0 mm, which makes the launch 49.8 ohm. Origin sits on the board edge. Pad 1 = signal, pad 2 = shell ground: two tabs on top, one solid plane underneath so the launch keeps its reference without relying on a zone fill."
